1|0@fivenightsatfreddys^1438869153#cttjm2h:Spode87$:FNAF1 was absolutely amazing. I was skeptical at first, but then my classmates told me about the hidden lore and I was sold at that point. There's something special in the first game for me. This feel was kinda back in FNAF3, but FNAF1 delivered it beautifully. IDK how to explain it... There's so many dark and twisted irony in FNAF1 and barely in FNAF3, it feels nothing like other video games. Also, GF was FUCKING TERRIFYING. It's a genius way to spook you - throw the fuck away all the shit you knew about the gameplay. Awesome. 
